# CETECH Delivery Engine — Always-apply governance

This repository is governed by `docs/DELIVERY-ENGINE-GOVERNING-RULES.md`.

Before modifying application code, schema, tests, build/release configuration, admin/customer UI, or authoritative documentation, read that file and the current status block in `docs/AI-HANDOFF.md`.

Also read `docs/PROJECT-GOVERNANCE.md` for source-of-truth hierarchy and process.

Treat the governing rules as mandatory unless the owner explicitly changes them.

If a requested action conflicts with a rule, stop and report the conflict rather than silently violating it.

Never infer permission to start a later stage.

Preserve every released tag/history, including `v1.0.0-rc.2` through current published `v1.0.0-rc.12`. Never move or rebuild an immutable published tag/artifact.

Never claim a test that was not run.

Do not modify FLAIROC unless the current task explicitly authorises deployment/QA work.

Published RC.12 (`1.0.0-rc.12`, schema `6`, release source `78594ad8962868683726373f58f4a8b1b48e4d0e`) is the current immutable release-candidate baseline. Protected master may contain later reviewed post-RC.12 hardening; read `CURRENT-WORK.md` and `docs/STATUS_CURRENT.md` for its exact SHA. Do not infer RC.13, Stage 15, Pilot, FLAIROC, production, or POS authorization.
